- Contributing is Adapt, with the policy deferred to S8; qualifiers such
  as 'inverted' and 'later' move out of the verdict column
- Size is not an Inspector element, so it moves out of the inventory table
- S6 after S5; S10 also after S2; S12 also after S11 (client-smoke)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
